  "guid": "com.shardbyte.livebitcoinpricesredux",
  "name": "LiveBitcoinPricesREDUX",
  "slug": "livebitcoinpricesredux",
  "teaser": "Adjust SPT Bitcoin prices to match Live!",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2862.webp",
  "downloads": 6472,
  "favourites_count": 25,
  "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Overview</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><h3>LiveBitcoinPricesREDUX</h3>\n<p>This mod dynamically updates the in-game price of <strong>Physical Bitcoin</strong> in SPT to match live Tarkov pricing.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Supports <strong>SPT 4.0</strong></li>\n<li>Rebuilt in <strong>C#</strong> for SPT 4.0</li>\n<li>Supports both <strong>PVE</strong> and <strong>PVP</strong> pricing modes through config</li>\n<li>Uses cached fallback data if the live API is unavailable</li>\n<li>Optional periodic updates can be enabled in config</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Bitcoin price data is fetched live from <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://tarkov.dev/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Tarkov Dev</a>.</p>\n<p>Stay synced with live Tarkov Bitcoin pricing in your SPT setup.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Installation</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ol>\n<li>Download and extract the mod archive.</li>\n<li>Copy the included <code>SPT</code> folder into your main SPT directory.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Final structure should look like this:</p>\n<p><code>SPT\\user\\mods\\LiveBitcoinPricesREDUX\\</code></p>\n<p>That’s it. The mod will update Bitcoin pricing automatically on server start.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Configuration</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>The mod includes:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>config/config.json</code> — main settings</li>\n<li><code>config/price.json</code> — cached price data used as fallback</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Main options</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><code>GameMode</code>\n<ul>\n<li><code>\"pve\"</code> = uses Tarkov PVE pricing</li>\n<li><code>\"pvp\"</code> = uses Tarkov PVP pricing</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><code>EnablePeriodicUpdates</code>\n<ul>\n<li><code>false</code> = update on server boot only</li>\n<li><code>true</code> = keep updating on the configured interval</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><code>UpdateInterval</code>\n<ul>\n<li>update frequency in seconds when periodic updates are enabled</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><code>EnableLogging</code>\n<ul>\n<li>enables console logging</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><code>Advanced.EnablePriceCaching</code>\n<ul>\n<li>enables cached fallback pricing</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><code>Advanced.CacheExpirationHours</code>\n<ul>\n<li>max cache age before it is ignored</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><code>Advanced.ApiTimeout</code>\n<ul>\n<li>API timeout in milliseconds</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><code>Advanced.UserAgent</code>\n<ul>\n<li>custom user agent for requests</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Additional Info</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ul>\n<li>Original mod by <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/62838-shardbyte/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Shardbyte</a>; this is an updated continuation.</li>\n<li>Original mod available <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1767-live-bitcoin-prices\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">here</a>.</li>\n<li>This version has been converted from JavaScript to C# for SPT 4.0 compatibility.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Note:</strong> This mod focuses only on updating Physical Bitcoin pricing. It does not rebalance the wider economy.</p></div></div></div>\n",
