      "version": "1.0.2",
      "description": "<h2>What’s new in 1.0.2</h2>\n<h3>Fixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Reworked core logic to run on server boot only (periodic updates now optional)</li>\n<li>Fixed live price fetching using <a href=\"tarkov.dev\">Tarkov DEV</a> API</li>\n<li>Improved fallback handling when API is unavailable</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>New Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Added support for PVE and PVP pricing modes\n<ul>\n<li>pve → uses gameMode: pve</li>\n<li>pvp → maps to gameMode: regular</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Added caching system (price.json) with expiration handling</li>\n<li>Added optional periodic price updates via config</li>\n<li>Added configurable API timeout and user agent</li>\n<li>Improved logging for better debugging and visibility</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Other Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Converted codebase from JavaScript to C# (SPT 4.0 compatible)</li>\n<li>Switched to basePrice API method for simpler and more accurate pricing</li>\n<li>Simplified and modernized config structure (config.json + price.json)</li>\n</ul>\n",
